    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the retirement and social security law, in relation to\nestablishing an optional twenty-five year retirement plan for certain\nemployees of the New York Power Authority",
    "basePrintNo": "S9068",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9068-2025",
